// suffices):
//   - outMAMA: Adaptive moving average (fast line)
//   - outFAMA: Following adaptive moving average, using half the alpha (slow
//     line)
//
// Element k of each output is the value at bar BegIdx+k of the returned
// [OutRange], and BegIdx is at least [Core.MAMALookback]: a range that ends
// before it returns NBElement 0.
//
// The lookback includes the unstable period the Core holds for FuncUnstIdMAMA
// (see [Core.SetUnstablePeriod]).
//
